{
  "tema": 6233,
  "slug": "todo-toda-adjetivo",
  "titulo": "Todo, toda, todos, todas (all, every, the whole)",
  "subtitulo": "Todo el día, todas las semanas.",
  "foto": "t06.jpg",
  "regla": "Todo agrees with the noun and goes before the article: todo el / toda la + singular = the whole, all; todos los / todas las + plural = all, every. The article (or a possessive or demonstrative) can't be dropped.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Todo** agrees with its noun: **todo, toda, todos, todas**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "It goes **before** the article, possessive or demonstrative. That little word is **required**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "",
            "Singular: _the whole, all_",
            "Plural: _all, every_"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "Masculine",
              "todo el día",
              "todos los días"
            ],
            [
              "Feminine",
              "toda la noche",
              "todas las semanas"
            ],
            [
              "With a possessive",
              "toda mi familia",
              "todos mis amigos"
            ],
            [
              "With a demonstrative",
              "todo este trabajo",
              "todas esas plantas"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Todos los / todas las** + time word = _every_: **todos los días**, **todas las mañanas**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Todo el mundo** = _everyone_. It takes a **singular** verb: **todo el mundo sabe**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Surfeé ==toda la== mañana.",
              "en": "I surfed all morning."
            },
